1.1.1 (2026-10-17)
- Header drawn in the Pip-Boy's own layout (title on the line, info underneath), so nothing is cut off by the rounded corners of the screen.
- Icon is now a Pip-Boy .img, so it shows in ITEMS > MISC.

1.1.0 (2026-10-12)
- The CAP symbol and the caps counter use a real bottle cap, and the payout table shows Vault Boy (Luck), drawn from the Pip-Boy's own game data in Fallout 3 or New Vegas mode. Falls back to the plain look if the data is missing.

1.0.0 (2026-10-05)
- Initial release of Atomic Slots, a three-reel slot machine with five bet sizes, a payout table, and a saved wallet.
